    skos:scopeNote "Schmachtenberger-Hagens bridge (added 2026-10-18) on the triple tgs:Concept.PowerSeekingAndComplicity thinkr:complements tgs:Concept.EducatingHyperAgents. Nate's hope is to change the minds of the few with outsized ability to change the system; Daniel explains why that is hard, since a system born of power competition selects dark-triad people for those positions. Nate names the same overlap himself in Frankly_53 and calls it 'a puzzle.' calculatedConfidence not yet set: run scripts/compute_confidence.py (it stays Candidate until the Evidence is reviewed and marked Curated)."@en .

